        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.0</title>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                    <h2>What's New in Version 1.0.0</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Initial Release</strong></li>
                        <li>X (Twitter) reply context detection</li>
                        <li>Detects if screenshot is a Post or Reply</li>
                        <li>Tracks if you've already replied</li>
                        <li>Style-based reply generation from your posts</li>
                        <li>Emoji and capitalization analysis</li>
                        <li>OpenAI GPT-4 integration</li>
                        <li>Secure API key storage in Keychain</li>
                        <li>Keyboard shortcuts (⌘N, ⌘K)</li>
                        <li>Automatic update checking</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3>Requirements</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>macOS 14.0 or later</li>
                        <li>OpenAI API key</li>
                    </ul>
                ]]>
            </description>
